        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, in all of our reportable segments, we have taken actions to consolidate our manufacturing footprint and distribution centers in order to optimize capacity, improve efficiency and leverage technologies while enhancing product quality.",
