        "filing_date": "2026-05-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we seek to leverage our existing customer base to cross-sell our products and solutions across our three business segments, thereby driving organic growth.",
        "start_character": 27600,
        "end_character": 27768
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001624794-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001624794-26-000027-5ea712493c7d2334",
        "accession_number": "0001624794-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In aggregate, we own the rights to the products that we manufacture and sell and are not materially encumbered by licensing or franchise agreements.",
